{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioSettingsContributed",
  "$description": "The generic settings section behind `$studio.settings` (specs/extensions.md §9.1), as a Jx document over the kit. One document serves both layouts an extension may declare: \"form\" is a single schema form over the whole section value, \"map\" is master-detail — the entry keys on the left, the selected entry's form on the right. The adapter (`surfaces/settings-contributed.ts`) hands in the title, the layout, the entry rows already marked as selected, and whatever the reader is part-way through typing; `settings/contributed-section.ts` decides what an entry may be named, what reaches `project.json`, and what the validator said about it. The schema form itself is an ISLAND: this document renders `form-host` and nothing inside it, because a form built from a JSON Schema is `ui/schema-form.ts`'s surface rather than this one's — the section places the element that surface hands back. The actions row is the second island: `panels/data-grid.ts` contributes it, and that one is still lit over Spectrum.",
  "tagName": "section",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "contributed"
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "What `.settings-section-title`, `.settings-two-col`, `.settings-list-panel`, `.settings-editor-panel`, `.settings-editor-header`, `.settings-empty-state` and `.settings-inline-form` said in `styles/overlays.css`, keyed on `part` and re-pointed at the studio token layer. This section was the LAST emitter of every one of them except `.settings-empty-state`, which `panels/settings-pane.ts` still writes when a project closes with the editor open — so those rules are dead in the stylesheet from here, and a central sweep removes them rather than this change, which owns no stylesheet. Two values could not come across. `.settings-editor-header h3` read `var(--spectrum-font-size-100, 14px)`, and a document is mounted in the pane rather than inside `<sp-theme>`, so it would have taken its hard-coded fallback every time; the entry name is a kit textfield now and carries the kit's own type ramp. And `.entry-name-input`, `.settings-form-panel`, `.settings-section` and `.contributed-section` had no rule anywhere at all — they were four entries on `check-styles.ts`'s orphan ledger, which is the ledger's point.",
    "display": "block",
    "& [part=\"title\"]": {
      "margin": "0 0 16px",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"actions\"]": {
      "$description": "The host-contributed actions row — Test Connection, Push Schema, Open Data Grid on the data sections. `.data-section-actions` never had a rule anywhere, so the row was whatever the buttons stacked up to; it is a row with a gap under it now.",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "gap": "8px",
      "marginBottom": "12px"
    },
    "& [part=\"columns\"]": {
      "$description": "The 1px gap over the border colour is the divider between the two columns: two panels on `--bg-panel` with `--border` showing through the gap, so nothing draws a rule of its own.",
      "display": "flex",
      "height": "100%",
      "gap": "1px",
      "background": "var(--border)"
    },
    "& [part=\"list\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "4px",
      "padding": "12px",
      "width": "200px",
      "minWidth": "200px",
      "background": "var(--bg-panel)",
      "overflowY": "auto"
    },
    "& [part=\"entry\"], & [part=\"new-open\"]": {
      "width": "100%"
    },
    "& [part=\"entry\"] > [part=\"control\"], & [part=\"new-open\"] > [part=\"control\"]": {
      "$description": "`.settings-list-panel sp-action-button` said `width: 100%; justify-content: flex-start`, and both halves belong to the button the row is made of rather than to the row: a kit action button centres its glyph and its label, which reads as a list of centred names.",
      "width": "100%",
      "justifyContent": "flex-start"
    },
    "& [part=\"new-form\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "6px"
    },
    "& [part=\"new-field\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "background": "var(--bg-panel)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "fontSize": "13px"
    },
    "& [part=\"editor\"]": {
      "$description": "`min-width: 0` is the one line `.settings-editor-panel` did not have and needed: a flex child's floor is its content, and the schema form inside this one is a whole form rather than the short cards Data Shapes puts here — so a long pointer or a wide row pushed the column past the right edge of the pane instead of scrolling inside it.",
      "flex": "1",
      "padding": "16px",
      "background": "var(--bg-panel)",
      "overflowY": "auto",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"editor-header\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "12px",
      "marginBottom": "16px"
    },
    "& [part=\"entry-name\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "maxWidth": "220px"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "h3",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "title"
      },
      "textContent": "${state.title}"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "actions-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/actionsState"
      },
      "cases": {
        "slot": {
          "$description": "An island: the host renders its own actions into this node and the document renders nothing inside it.",
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "actions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "body-slot",
        "role": "none"
      },
      "style": {
        "display": "contents"
      },
      "$switch": {
        "$ref": "#/state/layout"
      },
      "cases": {
        "form": {
          "$description": "An island: `ui/schema-form.ts` draws the whole section value into this node.",
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "form-host"
          }
        },
        "map": {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "columns"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "list"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "$prototype": "Array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/entries"
                  },
                  "key": {
                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                  },
                  "map": {
                    "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "entry",
                      "data-entry": "${$map.item.key}",
                      "data-jx-region": "${$map.item.region}"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "label": "${$map.item.key}",
                      "selected": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/selected"
                      },
                      "quiet": true,
                      "size": "sm"
                    },
                    "onclick": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/select"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "textContent": "${$map.item.key}"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "new-slot",
                    "role": "none"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "display": "contents"
                  },
                  "$switch": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/newState"
                  },
                  "cases": {
                    "closed": {
                      "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "new-open"
                      },
                      "$props": {
                        "label": "New Entry",
                        "icon": "plus",
                        "quiet": true,
                        "size": "sm"
                      },
                      "onclick": {
                        "$prototype": "Function",
                        "body": [
                          {
                            "operator": "call",
                            "target": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/openNew"
                            },
                            "value": []
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "textContent": "New Entry"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "open": {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "new-form"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "new-field"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "label": "New entry name",
                            "placeholder": "entry-name",
                            "size": "sm",
                            "value": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/newName"
                            }
                          },
                          "oninput": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/editNew"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "onkeydown": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "$switch": {
                                  "$ref": "event#/key"
                                },
                                "cases": {
                                  "Enter": [
                                    {
                                      "preventDefault": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "operator": "call",
                                      "target": {
                                        "$ref": "#/state/createNew"
                                      },
                                      "value": []
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "Escape": [
                                    {
                                      "preventDefault": true
                                    },
                                    {
                                      "operator": "call",
                                      "target": {
                                        "$ref": "#/state/cancelNew"
                                      },
                                      "value": []
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "jx-button",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "new-create"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "size": "sm"
                          },
                          "onclick": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/createNew"
                                },
                                "value": []
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "span",
                              "textContent": "Create"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "editor-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/editorState"
              },
              "cases": {
                "empty": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty"
                  },
                  "textContent": "Select or create an entry"
                },
                "editing": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "editor",
                    "data-jx-region": "${state.editorRegion}"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "editor-header"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "entry-name"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "label": "Entry name",
                            "size": "sm",
                            "value": {
                              "$ref": "#/state/entryName"
                            }
                          },
                          "onchange": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/renameEntry"
                                },
                                "value": [
                                  {
                                    "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          "onkeydown": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "$switch": {
                                  "$ref": "event#/key"
                                },
                                "cases": {
                                  "Enter": [
                                    {
                                      "operator": "call",
                                      "target": {
                                        "$ref": "#/state/renameEntry"
                                      },
                                      "value": [
                                        {
                                          "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "Escape": [
                                    {
                                      "operator": "call",
                                      "target": {
                                        "$ref": "#/state/cancelRename"
                                      },
                                      "value": [
                                        {
                                          "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "delete-entry"
                          },
                          "$props": {
                            "label": "Delete entry",
                            "hint": "Delete entry",
                            "icon": "trash",
                            "quiet": true,
                            "size": "sm"
                          },
                          "onclick": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/removeEntry"
                                },
                                "value": []
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "$description": "An island: `ui/schema-form.ts` draws the selected entry into this node.",
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "form-host"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
